description:
## Why
blob_download in mail/src/blob.rs has its own auth check that returns 401 when no user extension is present. This check does not respect auth.is_dev_mode(), so in dev mode (auth.required=false) the /jmap/download endpoint still returns 401.

## What needs to change
In blob_download, add a dev-mode bypass similar to the middleware:
  if state.auth_config.is_dev_mode() {
      // skip auth check, proceed with anonymous account
  }

## Evidence
Test dev_mode_download_endpoint_bypasses_auth in crates/mail/tests/jmap_basic_auth.rs:405 fails with 401 in dev mode.
